            "description_html": "<b>Ives Intermediate Pivot Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nIntermediate pivot hinge for doors that require additional support to keep the middle part of the door in line with the pivot hinges at the top and bottom. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nCannot be used with center hung doors.  Not intended to be load bearing.  For use only with 3/4\" offset pivot hinges.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Finish</b> Polished Chrome\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Handed</b>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this pivot hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually (1 pivot set)</b>\r\n</p>",
